# Example model: Qwen3.6-35B-A3B GPTQ, as measured on 2026-10-25..11-01 (production shape: 131072 context, 4 sequences).
# Values are data: never expanded, never executed. A value is bare, or in one pair of double quotes when it holds spaces.
MODEL_DIR=/root/.cache/huggingface/local/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-GPTQ
SERVED_NAME=qwen3.6-35b-a3b
MAX_MODEL_LEN=131072
MAX_NUM_SEQS=4
GPU_MEM_UTIL=0.85
PREFILL_LENS="8192 32768"
# MOE_DTYPE=int4_w4a16 (the default; the weight dtype of the MoE layers for `moe-tune`; `none` means the model has no MoE layers)
# The activation dtype `moe-tune` tunes the experts layer for. This model serves BF16 and the benchmark forces FP16 on ROCm, so the hook MOE_TUNE_ACT_DTYPE=bfloat16 is needed: measured in
# dew_flow_benchmark, research/RESULTS_vllm_029_r9700_speed_options.md § 15.3 (a file tuned with FP16 is 16.4 % slower than the default at M=640 with BF16 activations).
MOE_ACT_DTYPE=bfloat16
TUNED_CONFIG_DIR=/work/moe/tune/merged
MOUNTS="C/auto_gptq.py:/opt/python/lib/python3.14/site-packages/vllm/model_executor/layers/quantization/auto_gptq.py:ro C/gptq_utils.py:/opt/python/lib/python3.14/site-packages/vllm/model_executor/layers/quantization/utils/gptq_utils.py:ro"
EXTRA_SERVE_ARGS="--limit-mm-per-prompt.image 0 --limit-mm-per-prompt.video 0"
# The hybrid W4A16 linear shapes of `linear-bench`, from the checkpoint's qweight shapes as vLLM merges them: <name>:<K>:<N>:<layers> (the second name joins the two
# layers that share a shape). LINEAR_GROUP_SIZE=128 is the default.
LINEAR_SHAPES="linear_attn.in_proj_qkvz:2048:12288:30 linear_attn.out_proj+self_attn.o_proj:4096:2048:40 self_attn.qkv_proj:2048:9216:10 shared_expert.gate_up_proj:2048:1024:40 shared_expert.down_proj:512:2048:40"
